# Build context for the production image (Dockerfile, RFC 0179). Everything is excluded, then
# the three trees the image is built from are let back in. A new top-level directory therefore
# never reaches a build layer by accident, and neither does a workspace's compiled state.
*

!rust-toolchain.toml
!LICENSE
!ekos/
!web/
web/*
!web/api/
!web/ui/

# Build output and dependencies: rebuilt inside the image.
ekos/target/
web/ui/node_modules/
web/ui/dist/
web/ui/coverage/
web/api/.venv/
web/api/tests/
web/api/coverage.xml

# Credentials and local state must never enter a layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.ekos/
**/.ekos-web/
**/*.db
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
